  "details": "In 3pt if you are in seated mode when joining a instance, or when switching between avatars. You will revert back to normal height as if seated mode is turned off. Ui will show that its turned on. This is a degradation compared to live where it should always be applied when turned on.\n\nYou can turn it off and back on to work around this for now.\n\nChanging avatars:\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/946881839400882196/1134823561622732840/2023-07-29_07-20-37.mp4\n\nJoining instance:\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/946881839400882196/1134973942357033101/2023-07-29_03-07-38.mp4",
